   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Lab: Data Aggregation and Filtering\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook analyzes the dataset:\n",
    "\n",
    "**marketing_customer_analysis.csv**\n",
    "\n",
    "*Source:*  \n",
    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/data-bootcamp-v4/data/main/marketing_customer_analysis.csv\n",
    "\n",
    "We will:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Filter customers with low claim amounts and positive marketing response  \n",
    "2. Analyze premium and CLV patterns by policy type and gender  \n",
    "3. Count customers per state and filter states with > 500 customers  \n",
    "4. Compute CLV statistics by education and gender  \n",
    "5. BONUS: Policies sold by state and month  \n",
    "6. BONUS: Top 3 states with highest policy sales  \n",
    "7. BONUS: Response rate by marketing channel (using melt)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "511b46c8-4426-4f5b-9c3f-a63ae529df6c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
